0,Gyalsumdo language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gyalsumdo_language,"Language family. Sino-Tibetan. Tibeto-Burman.Gyalsumdo is a tonal language; however in Gyalsumdo, unlike most other Central Tibetan languages, the word, rather than the syllable acts as the tone bearing unit.",Gyalsumdo,Sino-Tibetan
