2,Gyalsumdo language,https://grokipedia.com/page/gyalsumdo_language,"Gyalsumdo is a Tibetic language belonging to the Sino-Tibetan language family, specifically within the Tibeto-Burman branch, and is classified under the Bodish subgroup as part of the Central Tibetan languages.",Gyalsumdo,Sino-Tibetan
