9,Gyalsumdo,https://docs.verbix.com/EndangeredLanguages/Gyalsumdo,Language: Gyalsumdo. Alternate names: Language code: gyo. Language family: Sino-Tibetan; Tibeto-Burman; Bodic; Bodish; Tibetic (SIL classification). Number of speakers: 300-400. Vulnerability: Threatened.,Gyalsumdo,Sino-Tibetan
